.TH KRAVEN 6 "2026-08-11" "kraven 1.0.0" "Games"
.SH NAME
kraven \- apex intrusion suite (Hollywood, remastered)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kraven
.RB [ \-\-fast ]
.RB [ \-\-frames
.IR N ]
.RB [ \-\-help ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kraven
draws a cinematic, multi\-panel fake "hacking" dashboard in your terminal,
in the spirit of the classic
.B hollywood
package but remastered: Matrix rain, a port sweep, exploit and brute\-force
sequences, a live hexdump exfiltration and the classic
.B "ACCESS GRANTED"
banner, all rendered with ANSI escapes and looping through mission stages.
.PP
It is
.B pure theatre:
it performs no scanning, no exploitation and never touches the network. All
addresses, services and output are randomly generated for visual effect only.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-fast
Disable the typing effect and run at an accelerated pace.
.TP
.BI \-\-frames " N"
Render
.I N
frames and exit. Useful for testing or for recording a clip.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show a short usage summary and exit.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B any key
Inject a line of "code" into the shell (hacker\-typer mode).
.TP
.B SPACE
Pause / resume the simulation.
.TP
.B q \fRor\fB Ctrl+C
Quit and restore the terminal.
.SH NOTES
Requires a terminal of at least 74x20. Uses only the Python 3 standard
library; no third\-party modules are needed.
.SH AUTHOR
Jarthur <jarthur.ch@gmail.com>
